codex_prompt.md is the default base prompt of OpenAI Codex CLI (codex-rs/models-manager/prompt.md at tag rust-v0.164.0),
Copyright OpenAI, licensed under the Apache License 2.0 (https://github.com/openai/codex/blob/main/LICENSE). Unmodified.
CC Session Sync hands it back to Codex in the model catalog for models routed through the local proxy, which is exactly
what Codex itself uses for models it has no metadata for.
